    {
      "title": "Use of Proceeds",
      "excerpt": "Use of Proceeds The proceeds from the sale of Shares of C-SPEF,\nnot including the amount of C-SPEF\u2019s fees and expenses (including, without limitation, offering expenses), will be invested by C-SPEF\nin accordance with C-SPEF\u2019s investment objective and strategies as soon as practicable after receipt of such proceeds, consistent\nwith market conditions and the availability of suitable investments. C-SPEF anticipates that it will take a longer period of time to allocate\nproceeds of its continuous offering to certain investments, principally certain Private Equity Investments acquired through Secondary\nTransactions and Primary Commitments, due to the nature of those investments. Such proceeds will be invested together with any interest\nearned in C-SPEF\u2019s account with C-SPEF\u2019s custodian. See \u201cPurchasing Shares.\u201d Delays in investing C-SPEF\u2019s\nassets may occur (i) because of the time typically req",
      "status": "source_excerpt_not_model_conclusion"
    }
